<!-- Digital Gift / Amplop Digital & Hadiah Pernikahan (Inspired by dewanakl/undangan) -->
<section class="my-5 text-center">
    <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm rounded-4 p-4 p-md-5" style="background: rgba(0,0,0,0.02); border: 1px dashed rgba(0,0,0,0.08) !important;">
        <i class="bi bi-gift fs-1 text-accent mb-2"></i>
        <h4 class="font-serif fw-bold text-dark mb-2">Tanda Kasih / Kado Digital</h4>
        <p class="text-muted small px-md-4 mb-4">
            Doa restu Anda merupakan karunia terindah bagi kami. Namun jika Anda ingin memberikan tanda kasih secara digital, Anda dapat menyalurkannya melalui rekening berikut:
        </p>

        <div class="row g-3 justify-content-center">
            <div class="col-md-6">
                <div class="card border-0 shadow-xs rounded-4 p-3 bg-white text-center">
                    <div class="fw-bold text-secondary small mb-1">BANK CENTRAL ASIA (BCA)</div>
                    <div class="fs-4 fw-bold text-dark my-1 tracking-wide" id="bankBca">1234 5678 90</div>
                    <div class="small text-muted mb-3">a.n. {{ invitation.partner_one_name }}</div>
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm rounded-pill px-3" onclick="copyAccountNumber('bankBca', this)">
                        <i class="bi bi-clipboard me-1"></i> Salin No. Rekening
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6">
                <div class="card border-0 shadow-xs rounded-4 p-3 bg-white text-center">
                    <div class="fw-bold text-secondary small mb-1">BANK MANDIRI</div>
                    <div class="fs-4 fw-bold text-dark my-1 tracking-wide" id="bankMandiri">9876 5432 10</div>
                    <div class="small text-muted mb-3">a.n. {{ invitation.partner_two_name }}</div>
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm rounded-pill px-3" onclick="copyAccountNumber('bankMandiri', this)">
                        <i class="bi bi-clipboard me-1"></i> Salin No. Rekening
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        {% if invitation.contact %}
            <div class="mt-4 pt-2">
                <a href="https://wa.me/{{ invitation.contact|replace({' ': '', '-': '', '+': ''}) }}" target="_blank" class="btn btn-outline-success btn-sm rounded-pill px-3">
                    <i class="bi bi-whatsapp me-1"></i> Hubungi Narahubung Panitia ({{ invitation.contact }})
                </a>
            </div>
        {% endif %}
    </div>
</section>
